      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The Appellant, who has been convicted for commission of offence under Sections 376(1), 506 of the IPC by the learned Ad hoc Addl. District and Sessions Judge, First Track Special Court, Jajpur in C.T. Sessions Case No.146 of 2018 and sentenced to undergo R.I. for ten years along with fine in judgment dated 7.10.2024, has prayed to release him on bail pending appeal.\n3.",
